{"id": "4824bf98-90cb-4862-af87-67cd04cd5f7a", "slug": "data-transformation-engine-2", "title": "Data Transformation Engine", "description": "Data Transformation Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Data Transformation Engine\"\ndescription: \"Data Transformation Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FB923C\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#FFEDD5\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Data Transformation Engine\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 4; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nData Transformation Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\n+ + + + Refining chaos into clear signals. Our adaptive processing engine ingests unstructured, unpredictable streams and delivers pristine, validated objects instantly. Witness the conversion. Raw Ingestion {\"code\": \"n…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Refining chaos into clear signals..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FB923C, background #050505, surface #FFEDD5, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Data Transformation Engine</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- CDNs -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-neutral-300 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-orange-500/30 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Outer Frame Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Global Vertical Boundaries -->\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute inset-y-0 left-6 lg:left-24 border-l border-neutral-800/40 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute inset-y-0 right-6 lg:right-24 border-r border-neutral-800/40 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Corner Markers (Outer Frame) -->\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute top-16 left-6 lg:left-24 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-neutral-700 text-xs font-mono pointer-events-none\">+</div>\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute top-16 right-6 lg:right-24 translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-neutral-700 text-xs font-mono pointer-events-none\">+</div>\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute bottom-16 left-6 lg:left-24 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 text-neutral-700 text-xs font-mono pointer-events-none\">+</div>\n        <div class=\"anim-frame absolute bottom-16 right-6 lg:right-24 translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 text-neutral-700 text-xs font-mono pointer-events-none\">+</div>\n\n        <!-- Inner Inset Content Area -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full px-12 lg:px-40 py-32 z-10 flex flex-col gap-24\">\n\n            <!-- Hero header for Masked Reveal -->\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-4xl flex flex-col gap-8\" id=\"hero-section\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">Refining</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">chaos</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">into</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">clear</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block text-transparent bg-clip-text\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%); background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, #f97316);\">signals.</span>\n                    </div>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"anim-fade-up text-base lg:text-lg text-neutral-500 font-light max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">\n                    Our adaptive processing engine ingests unstructured, unpredictable streams and delivers pristine, validated objects instantly. Witness the conversion.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Transformation Split Section -->\n            <!-- Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n            <div id=\"main-box\" class=\"relative w-full rounded-2xl p-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Layout Frame -->\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row w-full min-h-[500px] shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n\n                    <!-- Left Container: Chaotic Raw Data -->\n                    <div id=\"raw-data-container\" class=\"relative flex-1 p-8 lg:p-12 bg-[#0d0d0d] flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n\n                        <!-- WebGL Canvas Injection Point -->\n                        <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-50 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n                        <!-- SVG Noise Texture -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\" style=\"opacity: 0.15; background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"anim-header relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3 mb-12\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-neutral-500 uppercase\">Raw Ingestion</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Scattered Elements -->\n                        <div class=\"relative flex-1 w-full h-full text-xs font-mono text-neutral-600\">\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute top-[5%] left-[5%] rotate-[-6deg] opacity-50 transition-colors duration-1000 hover:text-white\">{\"code\": \"nil_ref\"}</span>\n\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute top-[20%] right-[10%] rotate-[14deg] opacity-40 blur-[1px]\">0x00F8E31B_fragment</span>\n\n                            <div class=\"anim-raw absolute top-[35%] left-[15%] rotate-[3deg] p-3 bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800/80 rounded-lg backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl z-20 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-700\">\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-500\">session_token:</span> <span class=\"text-red-900/60\">null</span><br>\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-500\">payload:</span> nil<br>\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-500\">timestamp:</span> err\n                            </div>\n\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute top-[55%] right-[20%] rotate-[-8deg] opacity-30 text-sm tracking-tighter\">null undefined [Array array]</span>\n\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute bottom-[25%] left-[10%] rotate-[12deg] opacity-60 blur-[0.5px] text-red-900/40\">SyntaxError: Unexpected token <</span>\n\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute bottom-[10%] right-[5%] rotate-[-4deg] opacity-40\">buffer_stream_99x.log</span>\n\n                            <span class=\"anim-raw absolute top-[75%] left-[40%] rotate-[6deg] opacity-70 border border-neutral-800 border-dashed p-1.5 rounded text-neutral-500\">[[record: Map]]</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Middle Container: Transformation Zone -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-48 h-32 lg:h-auto border-y lg:border-y-0 lg:border-x border-neutral-800/50 bg-[#0a0a0a] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden z-10 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)_inset]\">\n                        <!-- Grid Background -->\n                        <div class=\"anim-grid absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-40\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 16px 16px;\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Animated Lines Setup -->\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center py-8 lg:py-0 px-0 lg:px-4\">\n\n                            <!-- Desktop Flow (Horizontal Lines) -->\n                            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col w-full h-full justify-center gap-10 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 flow-anim-desktop\" data-delay=\"0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #f97316 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 flow-anim-desktop\" data-delay=\"0.6\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #fb923c 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 flow-anim-desktop\" data-delay=\"1.2\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #ffedd5 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Mobile Flow (Vertical Lines) -->\n                            <div class=\"flex lg:hidden w-full h-full justify-center gap-10 relative\">\n                                <div class=\"h-full w-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-1/2 flow-anim-mobile\" data-delay=\"0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #f97316 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"h-full w-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-1/2 flow-anim-mobile\" data-delay=\"0.8\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #fb923c 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Container: Clean Processed Output -->\n                    <div class=\"relative flex-1 p-8 lg:p-12 bg-neutral-900/10 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Premium subtle glow top right -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-orange-500/5 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"anim-header relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3 mb-12\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-white uppercase\">Verified Entities</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Clean UI Components -->\n                        <div class=\"relative flex-1 w-full flex flex-col gap-6 z-10\">\n\n                            <!-- Resolved Entity Card -->\n                            <div class=\"anim-clean w-full p-5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800 bg-[#111111] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-5 shadow-lg\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-800 to-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-center border border-neutral-700/50 shrink-0\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-300 text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white\">Alex Chen</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono\">usr_99zX772</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"sm:ml-auto flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 w-fit\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.8)]\"></div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-orange-500 font-normal\">Authenticated User</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Structured Data Table -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-800 bg-[#111111] overflow-hidden shadow-lg\">\n                                <div class=\"anim-clean grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-neutral-800 p-3.5 bg-neutral-900/50\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400\">Attribute</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400\">Extracted Value</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400 text-right\">Certainty</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"anim-clean grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-neutral-800 p-3.5 items-center hover:bg-neutral-800/20 transition-colors\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-mono\">action.type</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-200\">Enterprise Access Granted</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 text-right font-mono\">0.998</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"anim-clean grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-neutral-800 p-3.5 items-center hover:bg-neutral-800/20 transition-colors\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-mono\">trace.hash</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-200\">req_88b21kl</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 text-right font-mono\">1.000</span>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"anim-clean grid grid-cols-3 p-3.5 items-center hover:bg-neutral-800/20 transition-colors\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 font-mono\">threat.level</span>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-full bg-neutral-800 rounded-full h-1 max-w-[60px]\">\n                                            <div class=\"bg-orange-500 h-1 rounded-full w-[12%]\"></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"text-xs text-orange-400\">Low Risk</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 text-right font-mono\">0.945</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Inline Scripts for Animations and WebGL -->\n    <script>\n        // -------------------------\n        // GSAP Scroll Animations\n        // -------------------------\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        let htmlFloatingActive = false;\n\n        gsap.from(\".anim-frame\", { opacity: 0, duration: 2, ease: \"power2.inOut\" });\n\n        const words = gsap.utils.toArray('.reveal-word');\n        gsap.to(words, {\n            y: \"0%\", duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.08, ease: \"power3.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#hero-section\", start: \"top 80%\", toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\" }\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".anim-fade-up\", {\n            y: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.8, delay: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#hero-section\", start: \"top 80%\" }\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\"#main-box\", {\n            y: 40, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power3.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#hero-section\", start: \"top 50%\" }\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".anim-header\", {\n            x: -20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.2, ease: \"power2.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#main-box\", start: \"top 65%\" }\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".anim-raw\", {\n            scale: 0.8, opacity: 0, rotation: () => gsap.utils.random(-15, 15),\n            duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.08, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#main-box\", start: \"top 60%\" },\n            onComplete: () => { htmlFloatingActive = true; }\n        });\n\n        gsap.from(\".anim-clean\", {\n            x: 20, opacity: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.12, ease: \"power2.out\",\n            scrollTrigger: { trigger: \"#main-box\", start: \"top 60%\" }\n        });\n\n        gsap.to(\".anim-grid\", { opacity: 0.7, duration: 4, repeat: -1, yoyo: true, ease: \"sine.inOut\" });\n\n        gsap.utils.toArray('.flow-anim-desktop').forEach((el) => {\n            const delay = parseFloat(el.getAttribute('data-delay') || \"0\");\n            gsap.fromTo(el, { left: '-50%' }, { left: '150%', duration: 2.2, repeat: -1, ease: \"none\", delay: delay });\n        });\n\n        gsap.utils.toArray('.flow-anim-mobile').forEach((el) => {\n            const delay = parseFloat(el.getAttribute('data-delay') || \"0\");\n            gsap.fromTo(el, { top: '-50%' }, { top: '150%', duration: 2.2, repeat: -1, ease: \"none\", delay: delay });\n        });\n\n        // -------------------------\n        // Three.js / WebGL Integration\n        // -------------------------\n        const leftContainer = document.getElementById('raw-data-container');\n        const webglCanvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n\n        // Scene Setup\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, leftContainer.clientWidth / leftContainer.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        camera.position.z = 25;\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: webglCanvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(leftContainer.clientWidth, leftContainer.clientHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n        // Create chaotic background 3D data fragments\n        const fragmentsGroup = new THREE.Group();\n        scene.add(fragmentsGroup);\n\n        const geom = new THREE.BoxGeometry(1, 1, 1);\n        const mat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x444444, wireframe: true, transparent: true, opacity: 0.2 });\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geom, mat);\n            mesh.position.set(\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40,\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40,\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20 - 5\n            );\n            mesh.rotation.set(Math.random() * Math.PI, Math.random() * Math.PI, 0);\n\n            // Store unique floating properties\n            mesh.userData = {\n                floatSpeed: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1,\n                rotSpeedX: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02,\n                rotSpeedY: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.02,\n                yOffset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n            };\n            fragmentsGroup.add(mesh);\n        }\n\n        // HTML elements to float\n        const rawHtmlElements = document.querySelectorAll('.anim-raw');\n        const floatData = Array.from(rawHtmlElements).map(() => ({\n            offsetX: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n            offsetY: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n            speed: 0.8 + Math.random() * 1.2\n        }));\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function renderLoop() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(renderLoop);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Animate WebGL objects\n            fragmentsGroup.children.forEach(mesh => {\n                mesh.rotation.x += mesh.userData.rotSpeedX;\n                mesh.rotation.y += mesh.userData.rotSpeedY;\n                mesh.position.y += Math.sin(elapsedTime * mesh.userData.floatSpeed + mesh.userData.yOffset) * 0.02;\n            });\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n\n            // Animate HTML elements safely (using independent `translate` property to avoid GSAP conflict)\n            if (htmlFloatingActive) {\n                rawHtmlElements.forEach((el, index) => {\n                    const data = floatData[index];\n                    const x = Math.cos(elapsedTime * (data.speed * 0.7) + data.offsetX) * 6;\n                    const y = Math.sin(elapsedTime * data.speed + data.offsetY) * 8;\n                    // Natively animate positioning over time post-GSAP\n                    el.style.translate = `${x}px ${y}px`;\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            if (!leftContainer) return;\n            const width = leftContainer.clientWidth;\n            const height = leftContainer.clientHeight;\n            camera.aspect = width / height;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(width, height);\n        });\n\n        // Start WebGL Loop\n        renderLoop();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "data-transformation-engine-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/data-transformation-engine-2.jpg", "source_name": "data-transformation-engine-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 64, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T19:20:32.460389+00:00"}